# Finish gate

After implementation, in this order (`make help`):

1. `make test` — native suite
2. `make e2e` — simulator; review `$SIM_OUT`
3. `make flash` — only when 1–2 are green
4. `make device` — manual check on JC3248

Shortcuts: `make finish-host` (no board), `make finish` (+ flash).

Doc: `docs/guides/finish-gate.md`.
